<title>USA: BASEBALL-BRAVES BEAT YANKEES 12-1 IN WORLD SERIES OPENER.</title>
<headline>BASEBALL-BRAVES BEAT YANKEES 12-1 IN WORLD SERIES OPENER.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the opening game of</p>
<p>the World Series on Sunday:</p>
<p> Atlanta Braves	12  New York Yankees	1</p>
<p>(Braves lead best-of-seven series 1-0)</p>
</text>
